    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Dice is a grand strategy game set in a distant but not unfamiliar medieval world. Rule one of 60+ kingdoms, each with its own culture, history, and goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.poster.avif?t=1752620195\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.webm?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.mp4?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Unique trade goods with dynamic pricing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary, secondary, and tertiary economic sectors with chaining bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade province infrastructure and buildings for increased production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charter companies to find and produce new goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.poster.avif?t=1752620195\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.webm?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.mp4?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise armies and build navies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver your men across hundreds of conquerable tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your armies for defense, offense, speed, or all three</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diplomacy<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/8d2435c8554ad2af866d42b946660e39.poster.avif?t=1752620195\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/8d2435c8554ad2af866d42b946660e39.webm?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/8d2435c8554ad2af866d42b946660e39.mp4?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances and outwit rivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your reputation and relationships with foreign kings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >insult and undermine your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/2e7bc8865627764c756e4bc302deadd2.poster.avif?t=1752620195\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/2e7bc8865627764c756e4bc302deadd2.webm?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/2e7bc8865627764c756e4bc302deadd2.mp4?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique innovations and discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock trade goods, unit types, and buildings with new technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize the effectiveness of your researchers</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Dice is a grand strategy game set in a distant but not unfamiliar medieval world. Rule one of 60+ kingdoms, each with its own culture, history, and goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.poster.avif?t=1752620195\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.webm?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.mp4?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Unique trade goods with dynamic pricing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary, secondary, and tertiary economic sectors with chaining bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade province infrastructure and buildings for increased production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charter companies to find and produce new goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.poster.avif?t=1752620195\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.webm?t=1752620195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab